      "end": 584.03,
      "en": "Who are those kids walking down the aisle?",
      "zh": "沿着过道走来的那几个孩子是谁？"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 584.55,
      "end": 586.35,
      "en": "That's the flower girl and the rain bearer.",
      "zh": "那是花童和雨载者。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 587.36,
      "end": 589.11,
      "en": "I'm pretty sure that they're the groom's niece and nephew.",
      "zh": "我很确定他们是新郎的侄女和侄子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 589.6,
      "end": 591.03,
      "en": "Oh, they look so cute.",
      "zh": "哦，他们看起来很可爱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 591.53,
      "end": 593.09,
      "en": "I just hope the priest makes it quick.",
      "zh": "但愿牧师把仪式办快点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 593.48,
      "end": 593.69,
      "en": "I'm starving.",
      "zh": "我快饿死了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 594.49,
      "end": 595.75,
      "en": "I hope the food's good at the reception.",
      "zh": "希望婚宴上的菜不错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 596.51,
      "end": 598.25,
      "en": "That's all you ever think about, food.",
      "zh": "你满脑子就想着吃。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 599.53,
      "end": 601.29,
      "en": "Oh, I think the bride's coming now.",
      "zh": "哦，我想新娘现在来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 601.84,
      "end": 602.59,
      "en": "She looks gorgeous.",
      "zh": "她看起来美极了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 602.84,
      "end": 603.84,
      "en": "Wait, what's she doing?",
      "zh": "等等，她在干什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 603.84,
      "end": 604.84,
      "en": "Where is she going?",
      "zh": "她要去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 604.84,
      "end": 605.84,
      "en": "So great.",
      "zh": "太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 605.84,
      "end": 606.84,
      "en": "Does this mean that the reception is canceled?",
      "zh": "这是不是意味着婚宴取消了？"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 606.84,
      "end": 617.72,
      "en": "Okay, well, I'm going to be honest with you.",
      "zh": "好吧，我要对你说实话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 617.75,
      "end": 625.71,
      "en": "I don't know too much about marriages because, first of all, I'm not married and I've never really been to many marriages.",
      "zh": "我对婚姻了解不多，因为首先，我没有结婚，我从来没有真正去过很多婚姻。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 626.16,
      "end": 628.64,
      "en": "So, Erica, some questions for you.",
      "zh": "所以，埃里卡，给你一些问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 628.64,
      "end": 629.64,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 629.64,
      "end": 630.64,
      "en": "What are these bridesmaids do?",
      "zh": "这些伴娘是做什么的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 630.67,
      "end": 631.71,
      "en": "I mean, what are they about?",
      "zh": "我的意思是，它们是关于什么的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 632.4,
      "end": 633.29,
      "en": "What do the bridesmaids do?",
      "zh": "伴娘是做什么的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 633.49,
      "end": 634.91,
      "en": "Yeah, what are they doing there?",
      "zh": "是的，他们在那里做什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 635.19,
      "end": 639.31,
      "en": "Well, like I said earlier, the bridesmaids are the friends of the bride.",
      "zh": "好吧，就像我之前说的，伴娘是新娘的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 640.13,
      "end": 648.19,
      "en": "But the most important people, besides the bride and groom, are the best man and the maid of honor.",
      "zh": "但除了新娘和新郎之外，最重要的人是伴郎和伴娘。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 648.72,
      "end": 648.95,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 649.72,
      "end": 650.71,
      "en": "And what do they do there in the ceremony?",
      "zh": "他们在仪式上在那里做什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 651.32,
      "end": 655.21,
      "en": "Well, what they do is they sign the marriage license.",
      "zh": "好吧，他们所做的是签署结婚证。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 655.73,
      "end": 655.99,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 656.69,
      "end": 657.79,
      "en": "So they're like witnesses.",
      "zh": "所以他们就像见证人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 658.41,
      "end": 658.71,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 659.27,
      "end": 659.51,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 659.85,
      "end": 660.77,
      "en": "So, but wait a minute.",
      "zh": "所以，不过等一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 660.93,
      "end": 663.77,
      "en": "They sign the marriage license there in the church?",
      "zh": "他们在教堂签署结婚证？"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 664.15,
      "end": 664.69,
      "en": "Yeah, of course.",
      "zh": "对，当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 665.11,
      "end": 667.09,
      "en": "Right inside the church, you sign the marriage license.",
      "zh": "在教堂内，您签署结婚证。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 667.49,
      "end": 675.15,
      "en": "Wow, that's strange because, from what I know, in other countries, usually you will sign the marriage license before the ceremony.",
      "zh": "哇，这很奇怪，因为据我所知，在其他国家，您通常会在仪式前签署结婚证。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 675.82,
      "end": 677.36,
      "en": "So you get married twice?",
      "zh": "所以你结婚两次？"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 678.0,
      "end": 682.4,
      "en": "Yeah, you have like the civil marriage and then you have like the church wedding or whatever.",
      "zh": "是的，你喜欢民事婚姻，然后你喜欢教堂婚礼或其他什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 682.42,
      "end": 683.2,
      "en": "That's so complicated.",
      "zh": "这太复杂了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 683.96,
      "end": 687.24,
      "en": "Well, yeah, I mean, the church wedding is just the ceremony.",
      "zh": "嗯，是的，我的意思是，教堂的婚礼只是仪式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 687.56,
      "end": 688.92,
      "en": "It's not really anything official.",
      "zh": "这不是什么官方的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 689.36,
      "end": 691.62,
      "en": "Oh, in Canada, it's the official part as well.",
      "zh": "哦，在加拿大，这也是官方的部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 691.88,
      "end": 693.08,
      "en": "I guess maybe you're just more efficient.",
      "zh": "我想也许你只是更有效率。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 693.42,
      "end": 693.68,
      "en": "Maybe.",
      "zh": "也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 694.84,
      "end": 695.84,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 695.84,
      "end": 699.56,
      "en": "Well, this is a really fascinating, a really interesting subject, isn't it?",
      "zh": "嗯，这是一个非常引人入胜、非常有趣的主题，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 699.56,
      "end": 703.16,
      "en": "Yeah, because there's so many countries that have different marriage ceremonies.",
      "zh": "是的，因为有很多国家有不同的婚礼仪式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 703.16,
      "end": 706.28,
      "en": "I know that marriages in India last around seven days.",
      "zh": "我知道印度的婚姻持续了大约 7 天。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 706.42,
      "end": 707.06,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 707.34,
      "end": 711.5,
      "en": "I want to know more about how our users get married in their country.",
      "zh": "我想更多地了解我们的用户如何在他们的国家结婚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 711.9,
      "end": 712.16,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 712.16,
      "end": 718.56,
      "en": "So please go to our website at EnglishPod.com and tell us how you get married in your countries.",
      "zh": "因此，请访问我们的网站 englishpod.com 并告诉我们您如何在您的国家结婚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 719.08,
      "end": 721.24,
      "en": "Yeah, I can't wait to hear your stories.",
      "zh": "是的，我迫不及待地想听听你的故事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 721.6,
      "end": 722.74,
      "en": "Yeah, it should be interesting, right?",
      "zh": "是的，应该很有趣，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 723.16,
      "end": 723.5,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 723.84,
      "end": 727.66,
      "en": "Well, everyone, thanks for listening and until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "好吧，大家，感谢您的收听，直到下一次，再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 727.76,
      "end": 736.627,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
